Title: Northbank Cold Brew - "First Light"
Brand: Northbank Cold Brew (fictional)
Format: ~35s vertical social ad
Author: Mohammed Hassan bin Tayyeb

// A short UGC-meets-cinematic spec ad used to demo scene-director.

EXT. LONDON BRIDGE - DAWN

Mist hangs over the Thames as the city skyline wakes up. Commuters cross the bridge in silhouette.

MAYA (V.O.)
Six a.m. Deadline at nine. No pressure.

INT. MAYA'S FLAT - KITCHEN - MORNING

Maya, late twenties, shuffles in wearing a hoodie, laptop under her arm.

She opens the fridge and pulls out a matte black can of Northbank Cold Brew.

Her hand cracks the can. Condensation drips down the label.

MAYA
(to camera, half asleep)
Okay. Let's actually do this.

INT. CO-WORKING SPACE - SHOREDITCH - DAY

Maya walks through a buzzing co-working space, can in hand, nodding to friends.

DEV
You look way too awake for a Monday.

MAYA
Secret weapon.

She taps the can twice and smiles.

EXT. ROOFTOP - SHOREDITCH - DUSK

Maya and Dev clink cans on a rooftop as the skyline turns gold behind them.

MAYA
(quietly)
Shipped it.

The Northbank logo appears over the golden skyline.
